WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.000
(translator) 
There are three kinds

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:04.960
of suffering and the last one is
people have to get old and die.

00:00:04.960 --> 00:00:07.760
(Geshe Michael)  
Nice. Good. And nobody...

00:00:07.760 --> 00:00:13.300
nobody pays attention to her.

00:00:13.300 --> 00:00:17.100
She's not beautiful.

00:00:17.100 --> 00:00:22.440
Maybe she was beautiful—
now she's not.

00:00:22.440 --> 00:00:25.580
And she's not rich.

00:00:25.580 --> 00:00:28.060
And she's not young.

00:00:28.060 --> 00:00:31.900
And she cannot do flamenco.

00:00:31.900 --> 00:00:36.080
Okay? Then no one want 
to look at her.

00:00:36.080 --> 00:00:39.820
This happened to old people.

00:00:39.820 --> 00:00:43.780
It means, happens to all of us.

00:00:43.780 --> 00:00:46.760
There will come a time.

00:00:46.760 --> 00:00:49.200
We will be old.

00:00:49.200 --> 00:00:51.960
And we will be alone.

00:00:51.960 --> 00:00:56.020
Nobody want to be with us.

00:00:56.020 --> 00:00:58.860
We are not fun.

00:00:58.860 --> 00:01:02.720
We cannot go play 
with other people.

00:01:02.720 --> 00:01:08.540
Okay? So this is the future,
for everybody.

00:01:08.540 --> 00:01:10.920
Okay.

